<code>assert \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(this.size())-1; (this.get(i) == null) => (this.get(i+1) == \old(this.get(i))) || (this.get(i+1) == \old(this.get(i+1)));</code>

This assert statement ensures that for every element from the given index to the old size minus one, if the current element is null, the next element remains unchanged. Otherwise, the next element is also unchanged.
